{"seq":2,"slug":"net-fx-exposure-compute","title":"净外汇敞口口径与计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/cash-position-exposure/net-fx-exposure-compute","wordCount":2178,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"净外汇敞口口径与计算\">净外汇敞口口径与计算</h1><p>归集完成后，你手上有一张表：每个账户、每种货币、每个时点的余额。把这十几种货币按今天的汇率换算成本币加总，得到一个数字——这个数字<strong>不是敞口</strong>。它是&quot;总头寸&quot;，是一个会计上的折算结果，不回答任何风险问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么总头寸不是敞口\">核心概念：为什么总头寸不是敞口</h2><p>设想平台持有 2000 万美元和 1800 万欧元。按汇率折算后总头寸是某个本币金额。但如果你同时有一笔 2000 万美元的应付账款（下周到期）和一笔 1800 万欧元的应收账款（下周到期），这两笔头寸在到期时会自然对冲掉——<strong>你实际上没有任何外汇风险</strong>，你只是短暂地持有一堆会互相抵消的余额。反过来，如果这 2000 万美元是自有资金、那 1800 万欧元是客户备付金（必须原额退还客户、不能用去支付供应商），两者在币种上看起来抵消了，在用途上完全不能抵消。<strong>敞口的口径必须同时包含币种与可动用性两个维度。</strong></p>\n<p>净外汇敞口（net open position）的严格定义来自会计框架：它是某一时点上，以<strong>非功能货币</strong>计价的、其价值随汇率变动的净资产头寸。IAS 21 要求区分功能货币（functional currency，主体记账所用货币）与列报货币（presentation currency，对外报告的货币），只有非功能货币头寸才产生需要折算的汇率影响（来源：IASB, <em>IAS 21 The Effects of Changes in Foreign Exchange Rates</em>）。这个区分是敞口计算的第一个岔路口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"功能货币决定了什么算敞口\">功能货币决定了什么算敞口</h3><p>一个在德国的实体如果功能货币就是欧元，它持有的欧元资产负债不产生敞口——只有它持有的美元资产才产生敞口。所以敞口计算的第一步不是加总余额，而是<strong>按法律实体确定功能货币，再把该实体下所有非功能货币头寸逐币种汇总</strong>。忽视这一步，会把大量本不该算的余额算进敞口，进而导致系统性过度对冲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"敞口的三层分层\">敞口的三层分层</h2><p>工程上把敞口按<strong>确定性等级</strong>分成三层，这三层的计算方法与对冲方式都不同。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：已确定头寸（certain）。</strong> 已经发生的资产与负债，金额与币种都已确定——银行账户余额、已确认的应收应付账款、已签发的收付款指令。这一层的敞口是精确的，且必须在报表上体现。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：已承诺头寸（committed）。</strong> 已经签订合约但尚未发生现金流的项目——已签的采购合同、已承诺给商户的结算款、已签订但未交割的衍生品。金额确定、时点确定，但还没变成应收应付。这一层的敞口也是精确的，但入账口径要对（合同金额可能要按履约进度分摊）。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：预测头寸（forecast）。</strong> 尚未签订任何合约、但基于历史与业务计划可以合理预期的未来现金流——未来 90 天的销售收入、未来的平台手续费、未来的运营开支。这一层的敞口是估计值，它的价值在于告诉你要不要做超前对冲。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种口径及其代价\">三种口径及其代价</h3><p>三层如何汇总成一个数，是敞口口径的核心决策。常见的三种口径是：只看第一层（最保守，会计上最站得住）、第一 + 第二层（常见的资金管理口径）、三层全看并加权（用于套保政策设定，预测层的权重按确定概率递减）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>包含层级</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>会计敞口</td>\n<td>仅已确定</td>\n<td>财报折算、审计</td>\n<td>精确可验证</td>\n<td>忽略近期真实风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金敞口</td>\n<td>已确定 + 已承诺</td>\n<td>日常对冲决策</td>\n<td>覆盖实际现金流</td>\n<td>需维护承诺台账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划敞口</td>\n<td>三层加权</td>\n<td>套保政策与预算</td>\n<td>提前锁定</td>\n<td>预测偏差成新的风险源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自然对冲与残余敞口\">自然对冲与残余敞口</h2><p>自然对冲（natural hedge）指同一币种上同时存在方向相反的敞口，它们会互相抵消。前面已经说明，功能货币的选择本身完成了一部分自然对冲。除此之外，集团内部还有一类更隐蔽的自然对冲：<strong>同一实体内同时持有某币种的资产与负债</strong>（比如在巴西的实体持雷亚尔应收，同时欠当地供应商雷亚尔应付），这些在按币种汇总时自动相消。</p>\n<p>计算流程因此是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NetOpen</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>e</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>func</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Balance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetOpen}(c) = \\sum_{e} \\sum_{a \\in e} \\mathbb{1}[\\text{func}(e) \\neq c] \\cdot \\text{Balance}(a, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetOpen</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3274em;vertical-align:-1.2774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">func</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Balance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是币种，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是法律实体，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是账户。这个式子的含义是：只有在&quot;账户币种 ≠ 该账户所属实体的功能货币&quot;时，该余额才计入该币种的敞口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"残余敞口才是风险\">残余敞口才是风险</h3><p>残余敞口（residual exposure）是净敞口里<strong>没有被自然对冲掉、也没有被衍生品覆盖</strong>的部分——它才是真正暴露在市场波动里的量，也是&quot;需要多少对冲&quot;这个问题的分子。区分净敞口与残余敞口的意义在于：净敞口是账面上的事实，残余敞口是决策上的输入，两者在已有对冲合约时会分道扬镳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折算汇率与时点一致性\">折算汇率与时点一致性</h2><p>敞口计算必须把非功能货币头寸折算成功能货币或集团列报货币才能加总，而&quot;用哪个汇率、哪个时点的汇率&quot;直接决定了结果。IAS 21 的规则是：资产负债表项目按<strong>期末汇率（closing rate）</strong> 折算，损益项目按<strong>交易日汇率或期间平均汇率</strong>折算，权益项目按历史汇率折算，折算差额计入其他综合收益（OCI）而非损益。这意味着敞口报表和损益报表用的不是同一个汇率——这一条如果搞错，会导致&quot;敞口看起来没变但 OCI 剧烈波动&quot;的诡异现象。</p>\n<p>工程上的实现要点是<strong>汇率必须带时点与来源</strong>，且报表要声明自己用的是哪一种：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE fx_exposure_snapshot (&#10;  snapshot_id      BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  as_of            TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_id        BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES legal_entity(id),&#10;  functional_ccy   CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  position_ccy     CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  exposure_layer   TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (exposure_layer IN (&#39;CERTAIN&#39;,&#39;COMMITTED&#39;,&#39;FORECAST&#39;)),&#10;  net_amount       NUMERIC(28,8) NOT NULL,&#10;  rate_kind        TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (rate_kind IN (&#39;CLOSING&#39;,&#39;AVERAGE&#39;,&#39;HISTORICAL&#39;,&#39;SPOT&#39;)),&#10;  rate_used        NUMERIC(20,10) NOT NULL,&#10;  rate_source      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  rate_as_of       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  reporting_amount NUMERIC(28,8) NOT NULL,&#10;  computed_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (as_of, entity_id, position_ccy, exposure_layer)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fx_exposure_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  as_of            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legal_entity(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  functional_ccy   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  position_ccy     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exposure_layer   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (exposure_layer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CERTAIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMMITTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FORECAST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_amount       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_kind        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rate_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AVERAGE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HISTORICAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SPOT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_used        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_source      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_as_of       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reporting_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (as_of, entity_id, position_ccy, exposure_layer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么-rate_kind-必须显式落库\">为什么 rate_kind 必须显式落库</h3><p>没有 <code>rate_kind</code> 与 <code>rate_as_of</code> 这两列，&quot;为什么同一时点的两份报表数字不同&quot;会变成一个无法回答的问题。有了它们，差异可以立刻归因为&quot;一份用期末汇率一份用平均汇率&quot;，而不是变成一场跨系统的人肉排查。这张快照表在 <a href=\"exposure-report-snapshot\">敞口报表与快照</a> 里会被进一步要求不可变与可追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从净敞口到对冲需求\">从净敞口到对冲需求</h2><p>净敞口算出来后，需要决定对冲多少。这个决策变量是<strong>套保比例</strong>（hedge ratio），它的详细讨论在 <a href=\"../hedging-instruments/hedge-ratio-accounting\">套保比例与套保会计</a>，这里只说明敞口侧要为它提供什么输入。</p>\n<p>对冲需求的计算需要三个量：净敞口（本节的产出）、目标对冲比例、以及<strong>已有的对冲覆盖率</strong>。已有覆盖率来自尚未到期的衍生品合约的未平仓名义本金，这个数据在 <a href=\"../hedging-instruments/forward-option-instrument\">远期与期权对冲合约建模</a> 里定义。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HedgeGap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>NetOpen</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>open</mtext></mrow></munder><mtext>Notional</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HedgeGap}(c, T) = r_{\\text{target}} \\cdot \\text{NetOpen}(c, T) - \\sum_{k \\in \\text{open}} \\text{Notional}(k, c, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HedgeGap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetOpen</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">open</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Notional</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"为什么要按时点分桶\">为什么要按时点分桶</h3><p>按时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 分桶计算（而不是只算一个总量）是因为敞口有时间结构：未来 1 个月到期的敞口和未来 6 个月到期的敞口需要不同期限的对冲工具，用一笔 6 个月的远期去覆盖 1 个月的敞口，会在第 1 个月结束时留下一个裸露的缺口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[账户余额 归集后] --&gt; B{是否所属实体功能货币}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[不构成敞口 排除]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[按币种汇总 NET]&#10;    D --&gt; E[加已承诺头寸 合同台账]&#10;    E --&gt; F[加预测头寸 按确定性加权]&#10;    F --&gt; G[按到期时点分桶 1M/3M/6M]&#10;    G --&gt; H[减已有衍生品未平仓名义]&#10;    H --&gt; I[残余敞口 HedgeGap]&#10;    I --&gt; J{是否超过对冲阈值}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[进入套保决策 目标比例]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[保留监控 不动作]\">graph TD\n    A[账户余额 归集后] --&gt; B{是否所属实体功能货币}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[不构成敞口 排除]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[按币种汇总 NET]\n    D --&gt; E[加已承诺头寸 合同台账]\n    E --&gt; F[加预测头寸 按确定性加权]\n    F --&gt; G[按到期时点分桶 1M/3M/6M]\n    G --&gt; H[减已有衍生品未平仓名义]\n    H --&gt; I[残余敞口 HedgeGap]\n    I --&gt; J{是否超过对冲阈值}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[进入套保决策 目标比例]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[保留监控 不动作]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>总头寸不是敞口；敞口必须同时包含币种维度与&quot;是否属于实体的功能货币&quot;这一判断。</li>\n<li>敞口分三层：已确定、已承诺、预测；三层的组合方式决定了报表口径，口径必须先声明再计算。</li>\n<li>自然对冲在计算净敞口时自动完成，残余敞口才是需要外部对冲的量。</li>\n<li>折算汇率必须带 <code>rate_kind</code> 与 <code>rate_as_of</code>；IAS 21 下资产负债表用期末汇率、损益用平均或交易日汇率，混用会导致无法解释的 OCI 波动。</li>\n<li>对冲需求按时点分桶计算，用总量减总量会留下期限错配的裸露缺口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"净外汇敞口口径与计算","id":"净外汇敞口口径与计算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么总头寸不是敞口","id":"核心概念-为什么总头寸不是敞口"},{"level":3,"text":"功能货币决定了什么算敞口","id":"功能货币决定了什么算敞口"},{"level":2,"text":"敞口的三层分层","id":"敞口的三层分层"},{"level":3,"text":"三种口径及其代价","id":"三种口径及其代价"},{"level":2,"text":"自然对冲与残余敞口","id":"自然对冲与残余敞口"},{"level":3,"text":"残余敞口才是风险","id":"残余敞口才是风险"},{"level":2,"text":"折算汇率与时点一致性","id":"折算汇率与时点一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么 rate_kind 必须显式落库","id":"为什么-rate_kind-必须显式落库"},{"level":2,"text":"从净敞口到对冲需求","id":"从净敞口到对冲需求"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要按时点分桶","id":"为什么要按时点分桶"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多区域账户余额归集（Sweeping/Pooling）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/cash-position-exposure/multi-account-balance-sweeping"},"next":{"title":"敞口报表与快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/cash-position-exposure/exposure-report-snapshot"}}